### CSRF 토큰 발급
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/csrf

> {%
  client.global.set("csrfToken", response.body.token);
  client.global.set("csrfHeader", response.body.headerName);
%}

###

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-PRODIO-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "admin@prodio.com",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

###

### 내 정보 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me

###

### 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout
X-PRODIO-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
